---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const webPageSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebPage",
  "name": "Terms of Service",
  "description": "The terms that govern your use of Get Global Yields - a content and publishing site with no user accounts, no orders, and no personalized investment advice.",
  "url": "https://getglobalyields.com/terms/",
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service - Get Global Yields"
  description="The terms that govern your use of Get Global Yields, including acceptable use, intellectual property, and limitation of liability."
>
  <div class="bg-primary-900 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl">
      <article class="prose prose-invert prose-lg prose-a:text-accent-500 hover:prose-a:text-accent-400 max-w-none">
        <h1>Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mb-8">Last Updated: August 2026</p>

        <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") govern your access to and use of Get Global Yields (the "Site"). By visiting or using the Site, you agree to these Terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the Site.</p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>The Site is a content and publishing property covering financial topics for non-US investors active in the US market. There are no user accounts, no orders, and no payment collected through the Site. Using the Site - reading an article, submitting our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a>, or signing up for the newsletter - constitutes your acceptance of these Terms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Use of the Site</h2>
        <p>You may access and read the Site's content for your own personal, non-commercial informational use. You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Scrape, mirror, or republish substantial portions of the Site's content without our written permission.</li>
          <li>Use automated means to access the Site in a manner that sends more request traffic than a human user could generate.</li>
          <li>Interfere with or disrupt the Site's operation, or attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of it.</li>
          <li>Submit false, misleading, or abusive content through the contact form or newsletter signup.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>All articles, calculators, guides, graphics, and other original content on the Site are the property of Get Global Yields, except where otherwise credited. You may quote short excerpts with a clear attribution and a link back to the original page. Reproducing full articles or substantial portions elsewhere requires our prior written consent - reach out via the <a href="/contact/">contact page</a> to ask.</p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">No Investment Advice</h2>
        <p>Nothing on the Site constitutes personalized financial, investment, tax, or legal advice, and using the Site does not create an advisor-client relationship of any kind. See our full <a href="/disclaimer/">financial and affiliate disclaimer</a> for the scope of this, including the specific note on our regulatory status under Israeli law.</p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Affiliate Links and Third-Party Sites</h2>
        <p>Some links on the Site, including in our <a href="/best-brokers/">broker reviews</a>, are affiliate links, and the Site links out to third-party sites - brokers, tax authorities, and other resources - that we do not control. See the <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a> for our affiliate disclosure and third-party links policy in full.</p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Newsletter and Contact Form</h2>
        <p>If you submit the contact form or sign up for our newsletter, the personal information you provide is handled as described in our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>. You can ask us to stop contacting you at any time via the contact page.</p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>The Site and its content are provided "as is" and "as available," without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including as to accuracy, completeness, or fitness for a particular purpose. We do not guarantee the Site will be uninterrupted, secure, or error-free.</p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, Get Global Yields, its founder, and its contributors are not liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from your use of, or inability to use, the Site, or from any decision made in reliance on its content. This mirrors, and does not narrow, the limitation of liability set out in our <a href="/disclaimer/">disclaimer</a>.</p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Governing Law</h2>
        <p>Get Global Yields is operated from Israel. These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Israel, without regard to conflict-of-law principles. Any dispute arising from these Terms or your use of the Site will be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts of Israel.</p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Changes to These Terms</h2>
        <p>We may update these Terms from time to time. The "Last Updated" date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision. Continued use of the Site after a change constitutes acceptance of the updated Terms.</p>

        <h2 class="text-slate-100">Contact Us</h2>
        <p>If you have questions about these Terms, please reach us via our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. See also our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> and <a href="/disclaimer/">financial and affiliate disclaimer</a>.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(webPageSchema)} />
</BaseLayout>
